(13, 11, '', 'AIM5962233', 0, 'NISSI WELFARE SOCIETY P -RECEIPT  -PAYMENT,INCOME -EXPENDITURE   Local donation  income -expenditure reciept and payments Forign contribution rcipt and payment incime and expenditure  bank details debit andcredit vouchers  bal.sheet of project ,  head hon', 'projects of Nissi welfare society and work places  honorarium of chief of functionary editable for extended projects  name  and balanceshit', 0.00, 0.00, 'pending', 'pending', '2026-03-26 07:50:42', 32),
