(16, 14, '', 'AIM1118943', 0, 'Hostel Fees Customisation', 'Badruddin & Taherunnisa Hostels\r\n\r\nMonthly.    16000/-\r\n\r\n01-10. Rebate.      6000\r\n11-15. Rebate.      4000\r\n16-20. Rebate.      3000\r\n21-25. Rebate.      2000\r\n26-30. Rebate.      1000\r\n\r\nNo Rebate after 30th of the month\r\n\r\nQuarterly Mode.        29250\r\nHalf Yearly Mode.     57000\r\nYearly Mode.            108000\r\n\r\nLady Fatima Hostel\r\n\r\nMonthly.    17000/-\r\n\r\n01-10. Rebate.      6000\r\n11-15. Rebate.      4000\r\n16-20. Rebate.      3000\r\n21-25. Rebate.      2000\r\n26-30. Rebate.      1000\r\n\r\nNo Rebate after 30th of the month\r\n\r\nQuarterly Mode.        32250\r\nHalf Yearly Mode.     63000\r\nYearly Mode.            120000', 0.00, 0.00, 'pending', 'pending', '2026-04-30 07:01:46', 1),
(17, 15, '', 'AIM1322640', 0, 'Hostel Fee Customisation', 'Rebate on the Monthly Hostel Fee\r\n1. If Any Br. Guardian Pays Hostel Fee on or before the 10th of the month, a rebate of ₹ 6000 will be given.  If paid before the 15th, ₹4000,  before the 20th, ₹ 3000, before the 25th, ₹ 2000, and before the last day of the month, ₹ 1000. If the hostel fee is not paid even by the last day of the month, a Late Fine Charge of 100 per day will be applied to each of the due months\' fees, starting the next month.\r\n\r\n2. Rebate in Quarterly Advance Payment of ₹ 30000 (For Badruddin and Taherunnisa Hostels) and that of ₹ 33000 (For the Lady Fatima Hostel) will be ₹ 750.\r\n3. Rebate in Half-yearly Advance Payment of ₹ 60000 (For Badruddin and Taherunnisa Hostels) and that of ₹ 66000 (For the Lady Fatima Hostel) will be ₹ 3000.\r\n4. Rebate in Yearly Advance Payment of ₹ 120000 (For Badruddin and Taherunnisa Hostels) and that of ₹ 132000 (For the Lady Fatima Hostel) will be ₹ 12000.\r\n5. Fee Structure Sheet has already been shared through WhatsApp. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 0.00, 0.00, 'pending', 'pending', '2026-05-04 14:15:10', 1),
