-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">installed.</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">(For</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Mobile</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Apps</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">compatibility)</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Necessary</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">antivirus</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">/</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">security</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">software</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">as</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">per</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Client&rsquo;s</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">company</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">policy.</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left:14px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial MT&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">Client</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">for</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#3363a2\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">ayroll</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">&amp;</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">ESS</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">software</span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Any</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">computer</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">with</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">latest</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">web</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">browser.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"margin-left:14px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial MT&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Arial MT\'\"><span style=\"color:#285e99\">Connectivity</span></span></span></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">URL</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">for</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">HTTP</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">/ HTTPS</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">connection</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">to</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Payroll</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Server.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Connectivity to the server(s) to be provided to Numatix through specified ports for</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">development</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">and</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">support.</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"margin-left:14px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:19pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><strong><u><a name=\"_TOC_250007\"></a><strong><u><span style=\"font-size:19.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#335067\"><strong><u>Assumption</u></strong></span></span></span></u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size:19.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#335067\"><strong><u>and</u></strong></span></span></span></u></strong><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong><strong><u><span style=\"font-size:19.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"color:#335067\"><strong><u>Constraints</u></strong></span></span></span></u></strong><strong><u> </u></strong></u></strong></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:14px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Following</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">assumptions</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">have</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">been made</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">while</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">proposing</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">solution:</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Numatix based on Client&rsquo;s specifications has prepared this estimation. Any major change in</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">scope</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">will</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">have</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">an</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">effect</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">on</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">effort</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">&amp;</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">costing</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">and</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">will</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">be</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">mutually</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">decided</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">in</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">due</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">course.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Our scope is restricted to configuration and implementation of this software only. Any</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">hardware and software that is required to run and implement the solution in addition to the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">software provided by Numatix must be procured by the Client and have to be made</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">available to</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Numatix.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Client will nominate a project coordinator with thorough knowledge of the system for</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">providing support to our team during the entire life cycle of the project. He will be the Single</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Point</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">of</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Contact</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">(SPOC).</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Data</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">are</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">to be</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">entered by</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Client</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">required</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">for</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">acceptance</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">testing or</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">for</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">running the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">system.</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">We</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">shall</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">provide</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">technical</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">help</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">for strategy</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">planning</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">of</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">data</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">upload.</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Master</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">data</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">from</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">existing</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"page-break-after:always\"><span style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"Section4\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:52px; margin-right:17px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">system can be imported into our application provided that Client can produce the said data in</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">excel</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">template</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">provided</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">by</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">us.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"5\">\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Numatix will train the personnel designated by the Client to take regular backup and in case</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">of requirement, to restore the data back in the system. However, the onus of taking regular</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">backup of data and successful restoration is on Client. Numatix will fully cooperate with the</span></sp