t-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">existing</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">computing infrastructure</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">of</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Client is</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">outside</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">scope.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Client&rsquo;s</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Code</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">of Conduct</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">for</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">on-site</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">IS General</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">policy</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">and</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">IS</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Security</