tyle=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Delay</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">or failure</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">to</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">adhere</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">to</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">the</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">defined</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">project</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">schedule</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">may adversely affect the project timeline and in some cases call for fresh negotiation and</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">commercials.</span></span></li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Force</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Majeure:</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:52px; margin-right:42px; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">Numatix will not be responsible for any delays due to acts of God, violence, strikes, civil</span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\'Times New Roman\'\">commotio