(266, 'AIM-111124-742', '1289', '55,34', '', '', '', 'Full payment in advance.', '1', '', '1', '<p>Strategy for Aryan Dance music events in Kolkata and a detailed step-by-step approach:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScope of work<br />\r\n1.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Audience Analysis: Identify your target audience and keyword &nbsp;based on age, interests, location, and engagement preferences etc. Focus on demographics interested in music genres similar to your event.<br />\r\n2.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Goal Setting:&nbsp;<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Reach 1000 registration on event promotions.<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Maintain 1000 followers on your event&#39;s social media pages.<br />\r\n3.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Platform Selection: Target YouTube, &nbsp;Instagram &amp; Facebook &nbsp;platform popular in Kolkata&nbsp;<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Instagram: Meta paid Ad to research audience, keywords based on interest, geographic location, demographic segregation and core target audience research.<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Facebook: Meta paid Ad to research audience, keywords based on interest, geographic location, demographic segregation and core target audience research.<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;YouTube: Paid promotional activity for video ads, teasers, and event recaps.<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Ad Formats: Carousel ad campaign on Meta after targeting audience research<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Budget Allocation: &nbsp;daily budget on Meta Rs. 2000(For 60 days) approx 2500 lead generation and approx 40% conversion can be expected.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Analyze and Optimize<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Track Metrics: Monitor ad performance, engagement rates, follower growth, and conversions. Key metrics include reach, impressions, click-through rates, and engagement.<br />\r\no&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Adjust Strategy Based on time: Based on the time, adjust ad targeting, boost high-performing posts, and identify content that resonates most with the audience</p>\r\n', '0', '11-11-2024 05:56 pm'),
