(351, 'AIM-070125-688', '1543', '58,23', '', '', '', '60% in advance, next 20% middle of work, rest 20% the time of delivery.', '1', '', '1', '<p>Project Overview This project involves creating a mobile app for booking appointments at a doctor&#39;s clinic. The app will allow patients to schedule appointments online, generate a unique QR Code for each appointment, and manage these bookings seamlessly. The app will also provide notifications to patients through SMS. Scope of Work Core Features 1. Patient Registration and Login Patients can register using their mobile numbers and OTP verification. Secure login functionality. 2. Appointment Booking Patients can select their desired date and time slots. Limit of 100 appointments per day. 3. QR Code Generation Each booked appointment generates a unique QR Code. The QR Code will be scanned and verified at the doctor&#39;s clinic. 4. Appointment Details Patients can view appointment details such as date, time, and doctor&#39;s name. 5. Notifications SMS notifications for: Appointment confirmation. Reminders (e.g., 24 hours before the appointment). Cancellation updates. 6. Admin Panel (Web-based) The clinic admin can view, modify, and approve appointment requests. A daily report of appointments with QR Codes. Ability to close booking for specific dates.1. Basic Clinic Information Clinic Name: What is the official name of the clinic? Address: What is the complete address of the clinic? Phone Number: What is the contact number for appointment-related queries?&nbsp;&nbsp;2. Operational Details Clinic Working Hours: &Omicron; What are the clinic&#39;s working hours? Are there breaks (e.g., lunch hours) when appointments shouldn&#39;t be booked? Days of Operation: What days is the clinic open (e.g., Monday to Saturday)?</p>\r\n', '0', '07-01-2025 07:48 pm'),
