(361, 'AIM-210125-542', '1541', '58', '', '', '', '60% in advance, next 20% middle of work, rest 20% the time of delivery.', '1', '', '1', '<p>Annexure I<br />\r\nMost Important Services:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Material Dispatched from unit -1 To&nbsp; unit-2 or vice versa the record has to maintain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Detail require to maintain ( Gate pass- Invoice, Material images, Driver image/&nbsp;DL NO , Car image Number, Material type ( quantity, value, description),&nbsp;From where to where dispatch, Timing (In &amp; out), Permission by authorised person, Appointment to authorized person &amp; Inhouse delivery unit-1 to unit-2.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Test Certificate :- Product entry with category &amp; sub category, Unique number/ Batch number and search through Global search. Product &amp; Batch no wise ( T.C) will generate sample to send.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Purchase requisition:- Requisition format will be send by your end, After requisition send status will be shown. Container details will be added too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Dealer login:- Dealer will place purchase requisition. product entry &amp; inventory management system for finished product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Customer complain :- Status will be shown ( open, process, closed) and it will be intragated in kepro.in website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '0', '21-01-2025 04:08 pm'),
