(11, '10', 'AIM-030524-920', '7', 'Customization', '85238020', '1', '43000', 'Project', '0', 'Join as driver > All file types should be supported (driver document section upload)\r\n2.	Request a delivery > Choose an item > Pick up and drop off address should be clicked instead of buttons\r\n3.	Request a delivery > Choose an item > Pick-up location should be changed to “Pick-up address or postcode”\r\n4.	Request a delivery > Choose an item > Drop-off location should be changed to “Drop-off address or postcode”\r\n5.	If the pick-up address and drop-off address are on the same street, then also we should see the proceed button (distance and map should be shown)\r\n6.	Chat support continuous > It should not go off\r\n7.	Admin panel > Drivers > Active drivers > Continuous chat system should be implemented here.\r\n8.	A broadcast option should be also added. 9. To add start and end date in driver registration section below insurance upload box and to show these details in  driver details section\r\n'),
